capability integer/combinatorics  factorials, binomial coefficients, and products of ranges
  heroes  big.factorial, big.binomial, big.product_of_range
  go      Int.Binomial, Int.MulRange
  rust    -
  python  math.factorial, math.comb, math.perm, math.prod
  note    Go's MulRange includes its end, `product_of_range` leaves it out as `range` does; Python's `math.perm(n, k)` is `product_of_range(from: n - k + 1, to: n + 1)`, and `math.prod` of a list of integers is a `fold` with `multiply`

