  note    Python's eight; Go's Float names six of them: ToNearestEven `.half_even`, ToNearestAway `.half_away_from_zero`, ToZero `.toward_zero`, AwayFromZero `.away_from_zero`, ToNegativeInf `.floor`, ToPositiveInf `.ceiling`

