capability decimal/special  the values of a floating decimal that are no number: NaN, the infinities, a negative zero
  heroes  refused: an exact number has no NaN, no infinity and one zero; `f64` holds them, and the conversions from a float fail on NaN and the infinities
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  Decimal.is_nan, Decimal.is_qnan, Decimal.is_snan, Decimal.is_infinite, Decimal.is_finite, decimal.InvalidOperation, decimal.DivisionUndefined, decimal.DivisionByZero, decimal.DivisionImpossible
  note    -

capability decimal/bounded  a decimal of bounded precision and exponent: its limits, its next value, its classes
  heroes  refused: limits, a next value and classes of normal and subnormal belong to a decimal of bounded precision and exponent, a floating decimal; an exact decimal has none, and its exponent is bounded only where text is read, by `EXPONENT_MAX`
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  Context.Emax, Context.Emin, Context.Etiny, Context.Etop, Context.clamp, Decimal.next_minus, Decimal.next_plus, Decimal.next_toward, Decimal.is_normal, Decimal.is_subnormal, Decimal.number_class, decimal.MAX_EMAX, decimal.MIN_EMIN, decimal.MIN_ETINY, decimal.IEEEContext, decimal.IEEE_CONTEXT_MAX_BITS, decimal.Subnormal, decimal.Underflow, decimal.Overflow, decimal.Clamped, decimal.Inexact, decimal.Rounded and the same of Context
  note    -

capability decimal/digitwise  logic and rotation on the digits of a decimal of zeros and ones
